### =====================================================================
### Peticiones de prueba del Componente 2 (perfil "isolated" + WireMock)
###
### Se ejecutan desde VS Code con la extensión "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### o desde IntelliJ. Antes:
###   1) docker compose up -d                (en componente2-reservas/)
###   2) arrancar la app con el perfil isolated
###   3) generar tokens y pegarlos abajo:
###        .\scripts\generate-dev-token.ps1 -Subject 5590 -Role CLIENTE_REGISTRADO
###        .\scripts\generate-dev-token.ps1 -Subject "guest:demo-1" -Role VISITANTE
###        .\scripts\generate-dev-token.ps1 -Subject 1 -Role STAFF_TAQUILLA
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8082/v1
@clientToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_CLIENTE
@guestToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_INVITADO
@staffToken = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DE_TAQUILLA

### 1. Mapa de butacas ocupadas (público, sin token) → 200
GET {{base}}/reservations/shows/1024/seats

### 2. Cliente 5590 reserva 2 butacas (1250 puntos → 10 % fidelización) → 201
# @name reserva
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1024", "seats": [ { "row": 8, "column": 12 }, { "row": 8, "column": 13 } ] }

### 3. Otra persona intenta la MISMA butaca → 409 SEATS_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1024", "guestEmail": "invitado@email.com", "seats": [ { "row": 8, "column": 12 } ] }

### 4. Consultar la reserva (estado y expiresAt) → 200
GET {{base}}/reservations/{{reserva.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 5. Pago rechazado (token tok_declined...) → 402, la reserva sigue pendiente
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reserva.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gateway": "REDSYS", "paymentToken": "tok_declined_card" }

### 6. Pago aprobado → 200 con los códigos QR; se publica PaymentCompleted
# @name pago
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reserva.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gateway": "REDSYS", "paymentToken": "tok_visa_4242" }

### 7. Pagar otra vez → 409 ALREADY_PAID
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reserva.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gateway": "REDSYS", "paymentToken": "tok_visa_4242" }

### 8. Validar la primera entrada en puerta (taquilla) → 200; repetir → 409
POST {{base}}/reservations/tickets/{{pago.response.body.tickets[0]}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 9. Mis reservas → 200
GET {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 10. Invitado en día del espectador (sesión 1025, miércoles → 20 %) → 201
# @name reservaInvitado
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1025", "guestEmail": "invitado@email.com", "seats": [ { "row": 1, "column": 1 } ] }

### 11. El invitado cancela antes de pagar → 200 CANCELLED (butaca liberada)
DELETE {{base}}/reservations/{{reservaInvitado.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### 12. Errores de validación → 400 (fila 0, más de 10 butacas, showId ausente...)
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": [ { "row": 0, "column": 1 } ] }

### 13. Butaca fuera del mapa (la sala 1 tiene 10x15) → 400
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1024", "seats": [ { "row": 11, "column": 1 } ] }

### 14. Sesión no a la venta (PROGRAMADA) → 409 SHOW_NOT_ON_SALE
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "2048", "seats": [ { "row": 1, "column": 1 } ] }

### 15. Sesión inexistente → 404
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "9999", "seats": [ { "row": 1, "column": 1 } ] }

### 16. Cartelera responde 500 → Reservas responde 503
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "5030", "seats": [ { "row": 1, "column": 1 } ] }

### 17. Cliente reservando a nombre de otro usuario → 403
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1024", "userId": 42, "seats": [ { "row": 2, "column": 2 } ] }

### 18. Estadísticas para Analítica (staff) → 200; con token de cliente → 403
GET {{base}}/reservations/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 19. Box Office para Analítica (staff) → 200
GET {{base}}/reservations/box-office-data?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 20. Sin token → 401
GET {{base}}/reservations

### =====================================================================
### PAGO CON REDSYS (solo con PAYMENT_MODE=redsys; necesita internet)
### Con Redsys, los pasos 5-7 (pago directo) responden 409 USE_REDSYS_FLOW.
### =====================================================================

### 21. Nueva reserva para pagar con Redsys → 201
# @name reservaRedsys
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "showId": "1024", "seats": [ { "row": 2, "column": 7 } ] }

### 22. Iniciar el pago → 200 con { url, fields, order, paymentDeadline }
### Para ir a la web de Redsys usa: .\scripts\pagar-redsys.ps1 -ReservationId <id> -Token <token>
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reservaRedsys.response.body.id}}/payment/redsys
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 23. Confirmar con parámetros inventados → 400 INVALID_PAYMENT_RESPONSE (firma no válida)
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reservaRedsys.response.body.id}}/payment/redsys/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Ds_SignatureVersion": "HMAC_SHA256_V1", "Ds_MerchantParameters": "eyJEc19PcmRlciI6IjEyMzQifQ", "Ds_Signature": "firma-inventada" }

### 24. Página de vuelta sin parámetros (como si se cancelara en Redsys) → 200 "Pago no completado"
GET {{base}}/reservations/payments/redsys/return
